This gives us a large private address space:

10.0.0.0
     |
     └── 10.0.255.255

We'll divide it into subnets:

10.0.0.0/16
      |
      ├── 10.0.1.0/24 → Production
      |
      └── 10.0.2.0/24 → Management


## 3. STEPS TO CREATE VPC IN AWS:

Step - 1: Open AWS VPC & click create VPC
Step - 2: Choose "VPC Only" option
Step - 3: Enter the VPC details & Click create VPC
(Name Tag - MediVault-VPC, IPv4 CIDR - 10.0.0.0/16, IPv6 - leave it disabled by default, Tenancy - Default, VPC Encryption Control - None)

